---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro"
import logoFooter from "../images/PrimePoint_Health_logo_footer.webp"
---

<footer class="bg-primary text-navy-900 pt-24 pb-12" id="contact">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20">
                <div>
                    <Image src={logoFooter} alt="PrimePoint Health Logo" width={400} height={211} class="mb-6" />

                
                    <p class="text-navy-900/80 max-w-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">
                        Ready to drive meaningful change in your organization? Let's start the conversation. We welcome inquiries from health system executives, medical group leaders, payers, policymakers, and other industry partners who are looking for guidance and results.
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Follow Our Impact</p>
                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <a class="hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="#"><span
                                    class="material-icons-outlined">facebook</span></a>
                            <a class="hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="#"><span
                                    class="material-icons-outlined">alternate_email</span></a>
                            <a class="hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity" href="#"><span
                                    class="material-icons-outlined">link</span></a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">Get in Touch</h3>
                    
                    <div class="space-y-6 mb-8">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                                <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary">email</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-900/60 mb-1">Email</p>
                                <p class="text-lg text-navy-900 font-medium">info@primepointhealth.com</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                                <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary">phone</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-900/60 mb-1">Phone</p>
                                <p class="text-lg text-navy-900 font-medium">(617) 802-5635</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-navy-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                                <span class="material-icons-outlined text-primary">location_on</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-900/60 mb-1">Location</p>
                                <p class="text-lg text-navy-900 font-medium">265 Franklin Street, Ste 1702
Boston, MA 02110</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <p class="text-navy-900/80 leading-relaxed">
                            We will respond promptly to discuss your needs and explore how PrimePoint Health can help advance your strategic goals. Whether you have a specific project in mind or just want to learn more about our services, we are here to assist.
                        </p>
                        
                        <p class="text-navy-900/80 leading-relaxed">
                            Let us partner with you to unlock new possibilities in healthcare excellence. Together, we can make healthcare better for organizations, patients, and communities. We look forward to hearing from you.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="mt-24 pt-8 border-t border-navy-900/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 text-center md:text-left">
                    <span>Based in Massachusetts, serving clients nationwide</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 mt-4 md:mt-0 text-center md:text-right">
                    <span>(617) 802-5635</span>
                    <span><a href="mailto:info@primepointhealth.com">info@primepointhealth.com</a></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-12 text-center text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40">
                © 2024 PrimePoint Health. All Rights Reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>